  "content": "<p><span><span><span><span>这是一款中国风模组，主要添加了数种中式风格的盔甲及其对应材料。<br><br>每套盔甲都拥有独特的3D模型。<br><br>这些盔甲都具备各自对应的特性。<br><br>使用本模组能让你的生存玩法更加有趣！<br><br>由于我是初次制作模组，可能存在不足之处，敬请谅解！<br><br>如果你喜欢我的模组，请让更多人知道它。谢谢！୧〃•̀ꇴ•〃૭</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_e3276966-552b-42b8-8b06-e2b341195574.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"277\" height=\"156\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_feffed38-f52c-41aa-b101-46113a0b8ff1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"237\" height=\"158\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_113cead6-7cb8-4a54-93f5-967351fee27c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"279\" height=\"157\"></span></span></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_d9183a3b-dda0-4d40-91cb-13f30cdeb5ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"277\" height=\"156\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_e61527c1-2c28-4122-a825-5da08ee23e73.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"138\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112386/description_65a2841f-c5a2-4727-a181-80a3b4267db2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"153\"></p>",
